00:35:53,940 --> 00:35:57,269
AIN HANNAH AYNS SHEE JEH NYN KIONE GIARRIT

627
00:35:57,269 --> 00:35:59,069
VEIH VOISH COYRT FEA

628
00:36:00,659 --> 00:36:02,549
TA SHIN ER VAKIN EH LESH NYN SOOILLYN

629
00:36:02,550 --> 00:36:02,940
HENE

630
00:36:04,440 --> 00:36:07,079
MYR SHOH TRA TA SHIN FEDDYN OALDEY DOOINNEY

631
00:36:07,079 --> 00:36:10,019
SHOH DY ROW FOD MAYD CUMMAL LESH YN

632
00:36:10,050 --> 00:36:13,710
COVIN ECHEY AS STRIAH MY VISHOON BIALLAGH DYS

633
00:36:13,710 --> 00:36:17,339
SHEN AS TA FYS AIN ER AGH T'EH

634
00:36:17,340 --> 00:36:17,820
AGHTAL

635
00:36:19,110 --> 00:36:21,929
TA MOOAR BRIAGHT JEH MY CHARREY ARMINIUS JEH

636
00:36:21,960 --> 00:36:25,199
OLLOOSCOILL BLOOD UP EISHT DY YANNOO RECORTYS JEH

637
00:36:25,829 --> 00:36:28,860
VEL SPICE OOILLIANYS ESHYN TAYN DY GINSH DOU

638
00:36:28,860 --> 00:36:30,030
DY NOTEYR REA

639
00:36:31,110 --> 00:36:33,179
CHA NODDYM RIEAU DY JARROO AGH DY ROW

640
00:36:33,179 --> 00:36:35,940
EE Y VOAYL VOD DROGH GOLLRISH SHEN AS

641
00:36:35,940 --> 00:36:39,359
COSNEY GOO NOI YN TURKAGH ER CHEU ELLEY

642
00:36:39,360 --> 00:36:42,329
YN AWIN MOOAR ER E HUYR COAGYRAGHT THALLOO

643
00:36:42,329 --> 00:36:43,199
YN TURKAGH

644
00:36:44,429 --> 00:36:47,340
MY VEES SHEN YN AGHT EARISH CHA NEE

645
00:36:47,340 --> 00:36:50,850
DOOINNEY CADJIN V'AYN ER RONSAGHEY NOD OO HENE

646
00:36:50,849 --> 00:36:53,610
NISH RISH KEEADYN DY VLEEANTYN NY LURG VA

647
00:36:53,610 --> 00:36:57,690
SLEIH CHEET ER MOGHREY YN FER SHIAGHTYNOIL SCROUTEE

648
00:36:58,110 --> 00:37:01,560
COMMISHOON FEYSHT DUNNAL JEANMAYD APOLLO CHEU HOAL JUAN

649
00:37:01,559 --> 00:37:02,009
RIEAU

650
00:37:03,449 --> 00:37:06,149
REN NY HINSHYN NIARTAL AS YN AIGNEY MIE

651
00:37:06,150 --> 00:37:09,539
YIARRIN REGGIO GOLL MARISH STIAGH SYN OAIE ECHEY

652
00:37:10,139 --> 00:37:13,289
AS RED YERNISH CHEET NY NAH AIN

653
00:37:20,219 --> 00:37:22,409
AS USHTEY MOOAR ELLEY ASS CHYNDAAYS SY VIO

654
00:37:22,409 --> 00:37:26,130
JIU BRACHYURA AS SHEN GOLL SHIAGHTYN ER SHIAGHTIN

655
00:37:26,130 --> 00:37:27,150
AYNS CLAARE FAAGAIL

656
00:37:28,320 --> 00:37:30,870
AS AYNS REN SHEN OOILLEY HOOAR SHIAULL VIE

657
00:37:30,929 --> 00:37:32,880
ABBYR SHEN REESHT SY NUYOO

658
00:37:33,900 --> 00:37:34,380
LAA

659
00:37:36,929 --> 00:37:42,090
IS KILLING AS BLEIN VIE NOA OOILLEY AS

660
00:37:42,090 --> 00:37:46,469
CHIASS FOSSAE ID UN LAA FLIUGH AMAZING S

661
00:37:46,469 --> 00:37:49,049
NANNIE LHAIH HIS FINGERS FODDEE T'EH ALTERNATIVE

662
00:37:50,940 --> 00:37:53,279
LESH DTY HIE AS LHISAGH EEASEYDAGH HIE FEED

663
00:37:53,280 --> 00:37:56,339
ATCHIM HIS OF HASS YIASS FOAST AS FEAYSHIL

664
00:37:57,030 --> 00:38:01,409
IS IT ASSAILS IS LESSEE YN PHOSSAN SHOH

665
00:38:04,889 --> 00:38:06,150
SAASAGHEY RISHYN TA THIE

